  "visualBrief": "Complete connected Kuzminsky House exterior at Yasnaya Polyana: mapped compact white two-storey block, green standing-seam hip roof and two pale capped chimney stacks. Central shallow risalits and triangular pediments, tall arched upper glazing, supported front balcony with open lattice proxies and brackets, recessed lower front/rear entrances with closed treads/masonry stair sides, and northeast side porch with a low green roof, posts, recessed door and treads. Short approximate rear threshold treads follow the coarse original grade. Long rear elevation and blind side panels follow ordinary pictures with approximate hidden bay inventory. No copied texts, plaques, furnishings, artworks or photograph pixels.",
