    "architecturalHeights": "Approximate photo-led medium-fi scale: mapped17.95m by11.7m envelope, lower storey3m and upper storey3.8m, hip roof1.5m rise above6.8m eaves and two chimney caps about9.6m above floor. Map nominal8m is a scale cue, not a survey. Front/rear central panels, historic levels, thresholds, hidden bays and porch dimensions remain approximate."
  },
